### 4. **Regression Testing**

Ensures new changes don't break existing functionality.

```
Timeline:
┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Feature Added: Login form                │
│ Test Suite Created: 10 test cases        │
│                                          │
│ v2.0 Released: Bug fix in login          │
│ Regression Tests Run: ✓ All pass         │
│                                          │
│ v2.1 Released: New payment feature       │
│ Regression Tests Run: ✓ All pass         │
│                                          │
│ v2.2 Released: Email service update      │
│ Regression Tests Run: ✗ Login fails      │ ◄─── CAUGHT!
│                                          │
│ Fix Applied → Regression Tests: ✓ Pass   │
└──────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Regression Test Suite Example:**
```
Test Cases to Repeat After Each Release:

Smoke Tests (Quick validation):
✓ Application starts
✓ Login works
✓ Main menu displays
✓ Critical workflow completes

Core Functionality:
✓ User registration
✓ Email verification
✓ Password reset
✓ Profile update
✓ Payment processing
```

