## EXECUTION TECHNIQUES

### 1. **Test Execution Process**

```
Step-by-Step Execution:

1. PREPARATION
   ├─ Review test case
   ├─ Verify preconditions met
   ├─ Check test data available
   └─ Open fresh browser/app instance

2. EXECUTION
   ├─ Follow steps exactly
   ├─ Don't skip steps
   ├─ Document observations
   └─ Take screenshots if needed

3. OBSERVATION
   ├─ Note actual behavior
   ├─ Compare with expected
   ├─ Record timing
   └─ Check for errors

4. DOCUMENTATION
   ├─ Mark PASS or FAIL
   ├─ Fill actual results
   ├─ Log any deviations
   └─ Capture evidence

5. REPORTING
   ├─ Summarize findings
   ├─ Report defects
   ├─ Note improvements
   └─ Update test status
```

---

