### 6. **Test Metrics & Reporting**

```
Key Metrics:

Test Execution Rate:
= Tests Executed / Tests Planned × 100
Example: 45/50 = 90%

Pass Rate:
= Tests Passed / Tests Executed × 100
Example: 42/45 = 93%

Defect Detection Rate:
= Defects Found / Total Hours × 100
Example: 8 defects / 40 hours = 20%

Defect Severity Distribution:
Critical: 1 (10%)
High: 3 (30%)
Medium: 4 (40%)
Low: 2 (20%)

Bug Escape Rate:
= Bugs found in production / Bugs in testing
