#### Q7: What is Regression Testing?

**Theory:**
Regression testing is **re-running existing test cases** to ensure that new changes don't break previously working features.

**When It Happens:**

```
Timeline:

v1.0 Release
├─ Feature: Login created
├─ Tests written: 10
├─ All tests pass: ✓
│
v1.1 Release (Bug fix in login)
├─ Change made to fix bug
├─ Regression tests run: ✓ All pass
├─ Confirms fix doesn't break anything
│
